  "briefing": {
    "title": "GENESIS",
    "story": [
      "One crater. One last enemy. The Directorate remnant has pulled everything it has",
      "left into a fortress on the lip of the First Vein — the wound the Warden closed,",
      "or leashed, a lifetime ago — and it means to finish the argument with fire.",
      "",
      "SERA VANE: \"This is it. Everything we buried on this rock was spent to buy this",
      "morning. Take the field. End the war. And let something new begin.\"",
      "",
      "MARSHAL CORR: \"Every name on my ledger is watching, Warden. Spend it well.\""
    ],
    "objectives": [
      "Destroy the last Directorate stronghold",
      "Hold the genesis point above the Vein"
    ]
  },
  "debrief": {
    "win": [
      "The last Directorate guns fall silent above the Vein. On its lip, two armies",
      "that spent a year killing each other stand together in the ruins of the old world,",
      "and beneath them the planet does what the Warden decided it would do: sleeps, or",
      "listens. Either way, it is theirs to live with now.",
      "",
      "MARSHAL CORR: \"We came to take a world. We leave having been taken by one.\"",
      "SERA VANE: \"The war is over. The real work begins. Aether Prime is listening —",
      "or dreaming. Let’s give it something worth the difference.\""
    ],
    "lose": [
      "The stronghold holds. The Directorate cracks the Vein with everything it has left,",
      "and what comes up through the crack does not distinguish between the sides.",
      "You fought with honour. The planet did not notice."
    ]
  },
